@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US010 - To register a new publication in MiteLovers

' As a User, I want to register a new publication
' in the system, so that I can add the
' publication to my library.

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
end box


participant ":RegisterNewPublicationCtrl" as Ctrl

participant ":SystemPublicationRepository" as SystemRepo


' Publication is to be treated the same as "Item", supposedly

User -> UI : I want to add a publication to MiteLovers
activate UI
UI --> User : What publication?
User -> UI : publication
UI -> Ctrl : addPublication(publication)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> SystemRepo : addPublicationToSystem(publication)
activate SystemRepo
create "p1:Publication" as publication
SystemRepo -> publication: create(publication)


SystemRepo -> SystemRepo : validate(p1)
SystemRepo -> SystemRepo : add(p1)

SystemRepo --> Ctrl : true
deactivate SystemRepo
Ctrl --> UI : Success
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> User : The publication was added
deactivate UI



@enduml